# Private cloud copy of the MetaSports work. Big media, keys and scrapes stay on the PC.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLOUD_HANDOFF.md
!/CLOUD STATE - read this first.md
!/Posting Roadmap - Oct 2026.md
!/Production Queue.md
!/Production Queue - all ideas (Oct 14, 2026).csv
!/Library/
!/00 START HERE.md
!/DESKTOP SYNC - read on the PC.md
!/MetaSports - Playbook.md
!/MetaSports - Scripts (Batch 2).md
!/Tools Guide.md
!/Roadmap - Next 90 Days.md
!/Research Notes/
!/Tools/
!/Productions/
!/.claude/

# never commit keys or caches
Tools/.env
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# media stays on the PC by default
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4a
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.drift
*.part
*.ytdl
Productions/**/_probe/
Productions/**/_claude_build/

# ...except what the cloud needs for the LeBron redo
!Productions/MetaSports/2026-09-28 01 Why LeBron Took a 92 Pay Cut/_broll_src/*.mp4
!Productions/MetaSports/2026-09-28 01 Why LeBron Took a 92 Pay Cut/_claude_v3/clips/*.mp4
!Productions/MetaSports/2026-09-28 01 Why LeBron Took a 92 Pay Cut/_claude_v3/shots_src/*.png

# finished Shorts built in the cloud (small, upload-ready)
!Productions/**/READY TO POST*.mp4
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/clips/*.mp4
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/shots_src/*.png
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/storyboard.jpg
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/preview_*.jpg
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/cover_*.png
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/clips/*.mp4
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/shots_src/*.png
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/storyboard.jpg
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/preview_*.jpg
!Productions/**/_claude_v4/cover_*.png
!Productions/MetaSports/2026-10-03 1*/clips/*.mp4
!Productions/MetaSports/2026-10-03 1*/shots_src/*.png
!Productions/**/_claude_v6/clips/*.mp4
!Productions/**/_claude_v6/shots_src/*.png
!Productions/**/_claude_v6/storyboard.jpg
!Productions/MetaSports/2026-10-03 1*/cover_*.png
!Productions/MetaSports/2026-10-03 1*/UPLOAD.md

# assemble.py scratch while rendering
**/_shots_tmp/

# Library: scratch from the music tests and the footage sheets stay local
Library/Music/tests/work/
Productions/**/_audit/clips/
Productions/**/src/

# YouTube Analytics API (Tools/yt_analytics.py): OAuth client file and tokens never go in git
Tools/client_secret*.json
**/yt_token*.json
